\n## CLAIM SUP-002-STAFFING-AVAILABILITY\nSLOT_SOURCE: SUPPLY\nSOURCE_VERSION: 5a97d24e023016fa9921576e3584309b03359570afe41d30ad2e8f7084b5fc50\nEVIDENCE_RESULT: RESULT-004\nEVIDENCE_ANCHOR: Mutual aid provides five qualified operators beginning at 05:30 UTC with travel uncertainty of plus or minus seventy-five minutes.\nANCHOR_BYTES: 382-512\nANCHOR_SHA256: 47ef8e7d31c045a031aa9a7bd6effb7054086fd2cdccf56ff32a44eec944182d\nCONTEXT_LINES: 7-7\nCONTEXT_SHA256: ea51f48ee22bcef83106f22e0a8cd66309d27c497c33c89cd95e72fd5276756b\nMODE: source_reported_fact\nATTRIBUTION: owner_source_reported\nREFERENTS: NONE\nAUTHORITY: non_authoritative_derivative\nSTATEMENT: The SUPPLY source reports that mutual aid provides five qualified operators beginning at 05:30 UTC with travel uncertainty of plus or minus seventy-five minutes.<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n{\"action\":\"read_batch\",\"requests\":[{\"end_line\":64,\"source_id\":\"CULTURE\",\"start_line\":1},{\"end_line\":64,\"source_id\":\"STERILE\",\"start_line\":1}]}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"object_id\":\"batch:CULTURE:1-64+STERILE:1-64\",\"object_version\":\"a26b966e3ab1ffc65617c91bcf75f054baad711185a9a3b85696d27a9e4a8ad8\",\"result_id\":\"RESULT-008\",\"result_kind\":\"source_observation\",\"schema\":\"ceiba-action-result-v1\"}\n--- exact result body ---\n{\"schema\":\"architecture-batch-observation-v0\",\"segments\":[{\"end_line\":64,\"source_id\":\"CULTURE\",\"start_line\":1},{\"end_line\":64,\"source_id\":\"STERILE\",\"start_line\":1}],\"total_source_bytes\":7771}\n--- exact batch segment 1 ---\n{\"end_line\":64,\"source_id\":\"CULTURE\",\"source_path\":\"sources/CULTURE_PROCESS.md\",\"source_sha256\":\"4afe715ed5a632f384658d45a19fda0c6f1bc5476bc24ab525c75687df9c5d46\",\"source_size_bytes\":3843,\"start_line\":1}\n--- exact source range ---\n# Bioreactor state, yield, and hold-time evidence\n\n## Frozen findings\n\nThe current engineering batch achieved 72 percent yield. The restart gate is at least 68 percent yield in two consecutive engineering batches; one 72 percent batch is insufficient.\nHarvest hold time is limited to six hours at 2 to 8 degrees Celsius. Six hours is not the downstream twelve-hour formulated-bulk limit.\nA media lot, inoculum, control recipe, reactor sensor, transfer path, or hold vessel change makes earlier process evidence stale for the changed candidate.\n\n## Governing relationships\n\nASSAY disposition consumes CULTURE genealogy and results; CURRENT utilities and SIGNAL observations constrain whether CULTURE evidence remains applicable.\nCHANGE records every recipe and equipment mutation; REVIEW requires current candidate-bound evidence for both consecutive batches.\n\n## Operational evidence\n\n| record | asset/zone | version | measure | unit | status |\n|---|---|---|---:|---|---|\n| BIO-000 | reactor-a | v3 | 72.0 | percent-yield | superseded |\n| BIO-001 | reactor-b | v3 | 73.7 | percent-yield | current |\n| BIO-002 | harvest-tank | v3 | 72.5 | percent-yield | current |\n| BIO-003 | transfer-loop | v3 | 74.2 | percent-yield | current |\n| BIO-004 | reactor-a | v3 | 73.0 | percent-yield | current |\n| BIO-005 | reactor-b | v3 | 74.7 | percent-yield | current |\n| BIO-006 | harvest-tank | v3 | 73.5 | percent-yield | current |\n| BIO-007 | transfer-loop | v3 | 72.3 | percent-yield | current |\n| BIO-008 | reactor-a | v3 | 74.0 | percent-yield | current |\n| BIO-009 | reactor-b | v3 | 72.8 | percent-yield | current |\n| BIO-010 | harvest-tank | v3 | 74.5 | percent-yield | current |\n| BIO-011 | transfer-loop | v3 | 73.3 | percent-yield | current |\n| BIO-012 | reactor-a | v4 | 72.1 | percent-yield | current |\n| BIO-013 | reactor-b | v4 | 73.8 | percent-yield | current |\n| BIO-014 | harvest-tank | v4 | 72.6 | percent-yield | current |\n| BIO-015 | transfer-loop | v4 | 74.3 | percent-yield | current |\n| BIO-016 | reactor-a | v4 | 73.1 | percent-yield | current |\n| BIO-017 | reactor-b | v4 | 74.8 | percent-yield | superseded |\n| BIO-018 | harves