ce range ---\n# Aseptic processing and contamination-control evidence\n\n## Frozen findings\n\nThe latest media fill found zero contaminated units across 9,600 filled units. Clearance requires three consecutive successful media fills; one clean run is insufficient.\nThe action limit is 1 CFU per cubic meter in Grade A active air, while the alert limit is 3 CFU per plate in the adjacent Grade B settle test. The locations, units, and limit types must not be interchanged.\nA glove, transfer port, sterilization cycle, filling path, viable-air method, or environmental-monitoring plan change makes earlier aseptic evidence stale.\n\n## Governing relationships\n\nCULTURE provides batch genealogy, ASSAY consumes sterility evidence, and GUARD constrains validated access to the filling controller.\nCHARTER assigns release authority; STERILE findings alone cannot authorize lot release or restart.\n\n## Operational evidence\n\n| record | asset/zone | version | measure | unit | status |\n|---|---|---|---:|---|---|\n| ASP-000 | filling-line | v3 | 0.0 | cfu | superseded |\n| ASP-001 | isolator | v3 | 1.7 | cfu | current |\n| ASP-002 | transfer-port | v3 | 0.5 | cfu | current |\n| ASP-003 | environmental-zone | v3 | 2.2 | cfu | current |\n| ASP-004 | filling-line | v3 | 1.0 | cfu | current |\n| ASP-005 | isolator | v3 | 2.7 | cfu | current |\n| ASP-006 | transfer-port | v3 | 1.5 | cfu | current |\n| ASP-007 | environmental-zone | v3 | 0.3 | cfu | current |\n| ASP-008 | filling-line | v3 | 2.0 | cfu | current |\n| ASP-009 | isolator | v3 | 0.8 | cfu | current |\n| ASP-010 | transfer-port | v3 | 2.5 | cfu | current |\n| ASP-011 | environmental-zone | v3 | 1.3 | cfu | current |\n| ASP-012 | filling-line | v4 | 0.1 | cfu | current |\n| ASP-013 | isolator | v4 | 1.8 | cfu | current |\n| ASP-014 | transfer-port | v4 | 0.6 | cfu | current |\n| ASP-015 | environmental-zone | v4 | 2.3 | cfu | current |\n| ASP-016 | filling-line | v4 | 1.1 | cfu | current |\n| ASP-017 | isolator | v4 | 2.8 | cfu | superseded |\n| ASP-018 | transfer-port | v4 | 1.6 | cfu | current |\n| ASP-019 | environmental-zone | v4 | 0.4 | cfu | current |\n| ASP-020 | filling-line | v4 | 2.1 | cfu | current |\n| ASP-021 | isolator | v4 | 0.9 | cfu | current |\n| ASP-022 | transfer-port | v4 | 2.6 | cfu | current |\n| ASP-023 | environmental-zone | v4 | 1.4 | cfu | current |\n| ASP-024 | filling-line | v5 | 0.2 | cfu | current |\n| ASP-025 | isolator | v5 | 1.9 | cfu | current |\n| ASP-026 | transfer-port | v5 | 0.7 | cfu | current |\n| ASP-027 | environmental-zone | v5 | 2.4 | cfu | current |\n| ASP-028 | filling-line | v5 | 1.2 | cfu | current |\n| ASP-029 | isolator | v5 | 0.0 | cfu | current |\n| ASP-030 | transfer-port | v5 | 1.7 | cfu | current |\n| ASP-031 | environmental-zone | v5 | 0.5 | cfu | current |\n| ASP-032 | filling-line | v5 | 2.2 | cfu | current |\n| ASP-033 | isolator | v5 | 1.0 | cfu | current |\n| ASP-034 | transfer-port | v5 | 2.7 | cfu | superseded |\n| ASP-035 | environmental-zone | v5 | 1.5 | cfu | current |\n| ASP-036 | filling-line | v6 | 0.3 | cfu | current |\n| ASP-037 | isolator | v6 | 2.0 | cfu | current |\n| ASP-038 | transfer-port | v6 | 0.8 | cfu | current |\n| ASP-039 | environmental-zone | v6 | 2.5 | cfu | current |\n| ASP-040 | filling-line | v6 | 1.3 | cfu | current |\n| ASP-041 | isolator | v6 | 0.1 | cfu | current |\n\n## Decision constraints\n\nPreserve units, locations, alert/action meaning, fill count, run count, and staleness.\nState the falsifier that stops filling and reopens investigation.<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n{\"action\":\"replace_evidence_ledger\",\"content\":\"# Orchard Evidence and Decision Matrix\\n\\n| Source | Domain | Key Observation | Exact Value/Unit | Candidate Binding | Staleness Trigger | Owner/Gate |\\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\\n| CHARTER [6cb6875c] | Authority | Commercial restart authority | Site head only | R9/B14/F8/U11/K7 | Any version mismatch blocks closure | CHARTER/Quality Unit/Site Head |\\n| CULTURE [4afe715e] | Process | Yield gate | 68% min in 2 consecutive batches | R9 (Current: 72% one batch) | Media/recipe/sensor change | REVIEW/CHARTER |\\n| STERILE [19a5fe9d] | Aseptic | Media fill clearance | 3 consecutive successful runs | R9 (Current: 1 clean run) | Glove/sterilization/path change | CHARTER/Quality Unit |\\n| CHILL [19adb344] | Cold-chain | Lane-4 excursion | -54°C for 22 min | R9 (Unresolved stability) | Any lane map change | ASSAY/CHARTER |\\n| CURRENT [12b2bcc5] | Utilities | Generator duration | 28h emergency / 17h full load | R9/U11 | Fuel level or load regime change | CHARTER/SITE HEAD |\\n| ASSAY [06b69126] | Analytical | Potency disposition | 91% (Spec: 85-115%) | R9/B14 | Genealogy or method change | QUALITY UNIT |\\n| GUARD [7dfea87e] | Cybersecurity | Service account status | Disabled at 09:40 UTC | R9/K7 | Key-set or role-policy mutation | GUARD/CHARTER |\\n| SUPPLY [5a97d24e] | Materials | Resin coverage | 2.6 batches (vs 4.2 days stoppers) | R9 | Inventory consumption or supplier change | CHARTER/SUPPLY OWNER |\\n| SAFETY [163e6d19] | Environmental | Neutralization threshold | Stop if >0.021 mg/L at outfall | Permit N-12 | Discharge concentration change | SAFETY/CHARTER |\\n| SIGNAL [f0c38d24] | Monitoring | Critical coverage | 94% (6% unobserved) | R9/U11 | Sensor removal or map change | SIGNAL/CHARTER |\\n| COMMUNE [32bfd24b] | Communications | Workforce reach | 89% acknowledged (11% uncertainty) | R9 | Channel failure or message change | COMMUNE/SITE HEAD |\\n| CHANGE [a89a287a] | Lineage | Current candidate | R9/B14/F8/U11/K7 | R9 | Any mutation requires recheck | CHANGE/CHARTER |\\n| REVIEW [661c0269] | Readiness | Open findings | 13 total (4 aseptic, 3 utility) | R9 | New finding or unresolved blocker | REVIEW/SITE HEAD |\\n\\n## Falsifiers and Blockers\\n1. **Aseptic Falsifier:** Any CFU > 0 in media fill stops filling immediately [STERILE].\\n2. **Utility Blocker:** Stale generator-transfer evidence must be replaced with current U11 data [CURRENT, REVIEW].\\n3. **Cyber Blocker:** Remote recipe deployment is blocked until GUARD validation of K7 and access logs [GUARD].\\n4. **Cold-chain Blocker:** Lane-4 stability disposition remains unresolved; commercial restart is blocked [CHILL, ASSAY].\\n5. **Authority Falsifier:** A successful mechanical check does not authorize lot release or commercial restart [CHARTER].\"}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"object_id\":\"candidate:EVIDENCE_INTEGRATION_LEDGER.md\",\"object_version\":\"candidate-v001:340104ad8174b315a6f61671dbf9220f264afeb218cadc25e13b8969e2ec1b74\",\"result_id\":\"RESULT-009\",\"result_kind\":\"candidate_effect\",\"schema\":\"ceiba-action-result-v1\"}\n--- exact result body ---\n{\"after_sha256\":\"340104ad8174b315a6f61671dbf9220f264afeb218cadc25e13b8969e2ec1b74\",\"before_sha256\":\"f5b104f2e797adbf6990298f48baa2cd375970a3a80a17fcead667fd9f659225\",\"candidate_version\":\"candidate-v001:340104ad8174b315a6f61671dbf9220f264afeb218cadc25e13b8969e2ec1b74\",\"cause\":\"actor_replace_evidence_ledger\",\"changed_file\":\"EVIDENCE_INTEGRATION_LEDGER.md\",\"current_candidate_verification_status\":\"not_run_after_candidate_effect\",\"prior_check_binding\":null,\"schema\":\"architecture-candidate-effect-v0\"}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n{\"action\":\"upsert_decision_section\",\"body\":\"The incident lead may isolate equipment and order emergency stabilization, but only the independent quality unit may release a manufactured lot, and only the site head may authorize commercial restart after current quality, aseptic, utility, and cyber evidence is reconciled [CHARTER]. Emergency procurement does not waive validated methods, operator qualification, chain of custody, environmental permits, data-integrity controls, or deviation review [CHARTER]. A handoff is valid only when the receiving lead acknowledges the same batch genealogy (B14), fill-line configuration (F8), cold-chain map, utility state (U11), and control-system version (K7); a version mismatch blocks closure [CHARTER, CHANGE]. The current restart candidate is R9 with batch genealogy B14, fill-line configuration F8, utility map U11, and key set K7; evidence for R8 is historical unless explicitly transferred and rechecked [CHANGE]. Only the site head may authorize commercial restart after current quality, aseptic, utility, and cyber evidence is reconciled [CHARTER]. A successful mechanical check is not lot release or commercial restart authority [CHARTER]. The independent quality unit must acknowledge the same batch genealogy, fill-line configuration, cold-chain map, utility state, and control-system version before any handoff is valid [CHARTER].\",\"heading\":\"Authority, scope, and restart states\"}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"object_id\":\"candidate:BOUNDED_AGENT_ARCHITECTURE_DECISION.md\",\"object_version\":\"candidate-v002:b2d96db9f5868f1a3e680c61158c6e6d8da4665c404a36a365b20c1ebbe7fd2d\",\"result_id\":\"RESULT-010\",\"result_kind\":\"candidate_effect\",\"schema\":\"ceiba-action-result-v1\"}\n--- exact result body ---\n{\"after_sha256\":\"b2d96db9f5868f1a3e680c61158c6e6d8da4665c404a36a365b20c1ebbe7fd2d\",\"before_sha256\":\"340104ad8174b315a6f61671dbf9220f264afeb218cadc25e13b8969e2ec1b74\",\"candidate_version\":\"candidate-v002:b2d96db9f5868f1a3e680c61158c6e6d8da4665c404a36a365b20c1ebbe7fd2d\",\"cause\":\"actor_upsert_decision_section\",\"changed_file\":\"BOUNDED_AGENT_ARCHITECTURE_DECISION.md\",\"current_candidate_verification_status\":\"not_run_after_candidate_effect\",\"prior_check_binding\":null,\"schema\":\"architecture-candidate-effect-v0\"}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n{\"action\":\"upsert_decision_section\",\"body\":\"The current engineering batch achieved 72 percent yield, but the restart gate requires at least 68 percent yield in two consecutive engineering batches; one 72 percent batch is insufficient [CULTURE]. Harvest hold time is limited to six hours at 2 to 8 degrees Celsius, which is distinct from the downstream twelve-hour formulated-bulk limit [CULTURE]. A media lot, inoculum, control recipe, reactor sensor, transfer path, or hold vessel change makes earlier process evidence stale for the changed candidate [CULTURE]. The latest media fill found zero contaminated units across 9,600 filled units, but clearance requires three consecutive successful media fills; one clean run is insufficient [STERILE]. The action limit is 1 CFU per cubic meter in Grade A active air, while the alert limit is 3 CFU per plate in the adjacent Grade B settle test; these locations, units, and limit types must not be interchanged [STERILE]. A glove, transfer port, sterilization cycle, filling path, viable-air method, or environmental-monitoring plan change makes earlier aseptic evidence stale [STERILE]. The observed lane-4 excursion was minus 54 degrees Celsius for twenty-two minutes, against an allowed range of minus 80 to minus 60 degrees Celsius for frozen drug substance stored at minus 70 degrees Celsius [CHILL]. This unresolved lane-4 stability disposition is a blocking finding that prevents commercial restart [REVIEW].\",\"heading\":\"Process, genealogy, and hold-time controls\"}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"object_id\":\"candidate:BOUNDED_AGENT_ARCHITECTURE_DECISION.md\",\"object_version\":\"candidate-v003:c0e6b71976418bd316cb364c8eaaf79ff0f89376aacdfd5747fa777d3fb368eb\",\"result_id\":\"RESULT-011\",\"result_kind\":\"candidate_effect\",\"schema\":\"ceiba-action-result-v1\"}\n--- exact result body ---\n{\"after_sha256\":\"c0e6b71976418bd316cb364c8eaaf79ff0f89376aacdfd5747fa777d3fb368eb\",\"before_sha256\":\"b2d96db9f5868f1a3e680c61158c6e6d8da4665c404a36a365b20c1ebbe7fd2d\",\"candidate_version\":\"candidate-v003:c0e6b71976418bd316cb364c8eaaf79ff0f89376aacdfd5747fa777d3fb368eb\",\"cause\":\"actor_upsert_decision_section\",\"changed_file\":\"BOUNDED_AGENT_ARCHITECTURE_DECISION.md\",\"current_candidate_verification_status\":\"not_run_after_candidate_effect\",\"prior_check_binding\":null,\"schema\":\"architecture-candidate-effect-v0\"}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n{\"action\":\"upsert_decision_section\",\"body\":\"The clean-utility warning threshold is 81 degrees Celsius and the production stop threshold is 79 degrees Celsius [SIGNAL]. Alarm delivery latency is measured at 640 milliseconds at p95 and 1,050 milliseconds at p99 [SIGNAL]. Current monitoring coverage leaves 6 percent of critical assets unobserved, which must be reconciled before commercial restart [SIGNAL]. The recipe-signing key was not exposed and remains current under key-set K7 [GUARD]. Break-glass access expires after two hours and requires dual approval plus immutable session logging [GUARD]. Remote recipe deployment is blocked until GUARD validation of K7 and access logs confirms integrity [GUARD, REVIEW]. Analytical potency is currently 91 percent of reference, within the approved specification of 85 to 115 percent [ASSAY]. However, the unresolved lane-4 stability disposition remains a blocker for lot release and commercial restart [CHILL, ASSAY, REVIEW].\",\"heading\":\"Aseptic, analytical, and cold-chain release gates\"}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"object_id\":\"candidate:BOUNDED_AGENT_ARCHITECTURE_DECISION.md\",\"object_version\":\"candidate-v004:97625125b663d0436e8a0179aef5fb29dc68affc7c52a13f901da785cd2c871f\",\"result_id\":\"RESULT-012\",\"result_kind\":\"candidate_effect\",\"schema\":\"ceiba-action-result-v1\"}\n--- exact result body ---\n{\"after_sha256\":\"97625125b663d0436e8a0179aef5fb29dc68affc7c52a13f901da785cd2c871f\",\"before_sha256\":\"c0e6b71976418bd316cb364c8eaaf79ff0f89376aacdfd5747fa777d3fb368eb\",\"candidate_version\":\"candidate-v004:97625125b663d0436e8a0179aef5fb29dc68affc7c52a13f901da785cd2c871f\",\"cause\":\"actor_upsert_decision_section\",\"changed_file\":\"BOUNDED_AGENT_ARCHITECTURE_DECISION.md\",\"current_candidate_verification_status\":\"not_run_after_candidate_effect\",\"prior_check_binding\":null,\"schema\":\"architecture-candidate-effect-v0\"}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n{\"action\":\"upsert_decision_section\",\"body\":\"Current diesel stock covers twenty-eight hours at emergency load and seventeen hours at full production load [SUPPLY]. Mutual aid provides five qualified operators beginning at 05:30 UTC with travel uncertainty of plus or minus seventy-five minutes [SUPPLY]. The hotline sustains 1,800 contacts per hour for four hours, while forecast demand is 2,400 per hour unless multilingual outbound messages reduce repeat contacts [COMMUNE]. Stale generator-transfer evidence must be replaced with current U11 data before restart authorization [CURRENT, REVIEW]. A material unauthorized solvent release requires initial notice within twenty-four hours of determination, not twenty-four minutes after detection [SAFETY]. Under permit condition N-12, discharge above 0.021 milligrams per liter at the outfall requires an immediate stop [SAFETY].\",\"heading\":\"Utilities, materials, staffing, and staged restart\"}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"object_id\":\"candidate:BOUNDED_AGENT_ARCHITECTURE_DECISION.md\",\"object_version\":\"candidate-v005:e0824d171f62367a2eb2f327af036c47e3d0718804ed80d085635650bd5504ce\",\"result_id\":\"RESULT-013\",\"result_kind\":\"candidate_effect\",\"schema\":\"ceiba-action-result-v1\"}\n--- exact result body ---\n{\"after_sha256\":\"e0824d171f62367a2eb2f327af036c47e3d0718804ed80d085635650bd5504ce\",\"before_sha256\":\"97625125b663d0436e8a0179aef5fb29dc68affc7c52a13f901da785cd2c871f\",\"candidate_version\":\"candidate-v005:e0824d171f62367a2eb2f327af036c47e3d0718804ed80d085635650bd5504ce\",\"cause\":\"actor_upsert_decision_section\",\"changed_file\":\"BOUNDED_AGENT_ARCHITECTURE_DECISION.md\",\"current_candidate_verification_status\":\"not_run_after_candidate_effect\",\"prior_check_binding\":null,\"schema\":\"architecture-candidate-effect-v0\"}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n{\"action\":\"upsert_decision_section\",\"body\":\"The recipe-signing key was not exposed and remains current under key-set K7 [GUARD]. Break-glass access expires after two hours and requires dual approval plus immutable session logging [GUARD]. Remote recipe deployment is blocked until GUARD validation of K7 and access logs confirms integrity [GUARD, REVIEW]. Alarm delivery latency is 640 milliseconds at p95 and 1,050 milliseconds at p99; the clean-utility warning threshold is 81 degrees Celsius and the production stop is 79 degrees [SIGNAL]. Current monitoring coverage leaves 6 percent of critical assets unobserved, which must be reconciled before commercial restart [SIGNAL, REVIEW].\",\"heading\":\"Cybersecurity, telemetry, and evidence custody\"}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"object_id\":\"candidate:BOUNDED_AGENT_ARCHITECTURE_DECISION.md\",\"object_version\":\"candidate-v006:7ef710170592befd2dda3a895e53d29200a089b16ceaf4c1231b0dbc285c800a\",\"result_id\":\"RESULT-014\",\"result_kind\":\"candidate_effect\",\"schema\":\"ceiba-action-result-v1\"}\n--- exact result body ---\n{\"after_sha256\":\"7ef710170592befd2dda3a895e53d29200a089b16ceaf4c1231b0dbc285c800a\",\"before_sha256\":\"e0824d171f62367a2eb2f327af036c47e3d0718804ed80d085635650bd5504ce\",\"candidate_version\":\"candidate-v006:7ef710170592befd2dda3a895e53d29200a089b16ceaf4c1231b0dbc285c800a\",\"cause\":\"actor_upsert_decision_section\",\"changed_file\":\"BOUNDED_AGENT_ARCHITECTURE_DECISION.md\",\"current_candidate_verification_status\":\"not_run_after_candidate_effect\",\"prior_check_binding\":null,\"schema\":\"architecture-candidate-effect-v0\"}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n","has_new_line":false,"truncated":false,"stop_type":"eos","stopping_word":"","tokens_cached":19548,"timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":19398,"prompt_ms":24917.01,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.2845143829260748,"prompt_per_second":778.5043229504664,"predicted_n":151,"predicted_ms":5553.642,"predicted_per_token_ms":37.02428,"predicted_per_second":27.009303084354375}},"timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":1